{"title":"2019 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1c","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1.5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1.5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Verifying_Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Verifying Solutions</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2019 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/5/5c566ee23b76301bd1129a0dd160fa8aca53daad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{x^2}-\\frac{1}{x}=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"94\" height=\"38\" />, determine all possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiplying both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/e/a6e87b69178d197c13b13d595e7e6817cf20df95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/9/0098b65c069b63f888a2645c2b6fa7902e906fba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 - x = 2x^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>We then see:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/b/24b386c586545adc8a4dca67a8e9c21933fe8f8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x^{2} + x - 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"126\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>From the quadratic formula, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/8/98861445ec82acf55425753d1892854288bcc99d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{-1 \\pm \\sqrt{1^{2} - 4 \\times -1 \\times 2}}{2 \\times 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"226\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/e/56ee4d873f28698480aa2022b03218fcedb0ce98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{-1 \\pm \\sqrt{1 + 8}}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"141\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/b/36bc1f756709d93550de22e05edf2551627fa4fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{-1 \\pm \\sqrt{9}}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"110\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/9/ec9ed693bbe94f76ba84e67f5d8b7eb00ec59e48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{-1 \\pm 3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"95\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/d/9ddabac684028f8f1d538ee33b33d9e7331a5338.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{-1 - 3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"95\" height=\"38\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/5/1351987b6ed6a6cd2416f7dd96e85025639c9ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{-1 + 3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"95\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/c/91cb0bdb664c856df74ac7ba881bea86e624d305.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{-4}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"64\" height=\"38\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/d/8adb8a18ca230cdb088a95bfaa7f4fbfb707eb0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{2}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/6/ee693fe7d02b01ed97ced406ac0b56287034b0be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x = -1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"71\" height=\"26\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/0/640b522a9c507eedf2cfa63eefae3c640cf0ddbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x = \\frac{1}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"61\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~originally by Yuhao2012, changes made by anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1.5\">Solution 1.5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1.5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Instead of using the quadratic formula to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, we can realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> multiply to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/0/a502602fb49c79b1a02d287ded0c1824d8cb68d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"56\" height=\"15\" /> but also add up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. This means that we can factor the equation:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/d/6dd25e013eeb0079e3f2d34c74a371b0ea3f6b3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x^{2} + 2x - x - 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"168\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/9/a59d2ea03d314dab650a20f1d5841c419c75bbdb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x(x + 1) - (x + 1) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"189\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/b/e5b06f7feaa77979e2c88fd7a397f63c7fb827bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2x - 1)(x + 1) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"156\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>From this, either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/1/2c17e719f3475f7a32fa595f0e7e584d0474ce4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x - 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"86\" height=\"15\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/6/88663eb3d0085a490e77c997290fe2fd19d052de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/1/2c17e719f3475f7a32fa595f0e7e584d0474ce4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x - 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"86\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/8/448c1aca28d8c864d1a47ee2cbf00099c36d4e80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/0/640b522a9c507eedf2cfa63eefae3c640cf0ddbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x = \\frac{1}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"61\" height=\"49\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/6/88663eb3d0085a490e77c997290fe2fd19d052de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/8/2885c7e965274e306657da11085f1e6f004db403.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 0 - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/6/ee693fe7d02b01ed97ced406ac0b56287034b0be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x = -1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"71\" height=\"26\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Verifying_Solutions\">Verifying Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Verifying Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When we plug in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/4/8d4c38a419ae56f13a202216dd45a1978bc91a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> into the original equation, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/d/31d0eb3aadc782f005af19a9de0fc43a57ba2613.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{(-1)^{2}} - \\frac{1}{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"100\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1ab2c0280fdaf07cbea47407e1234b218454049e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{1}{1} - (-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"94\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/f/74f81772e8d0d01def2e88fa71c8663ae42ffadc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=1 + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/f/02feac2e77869c58d31a1f35ca2bc358e5a7758a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=2$\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Since this matches <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in the original equation, we have a correct answer.\n</p><p>Next, when we plug in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/f/a2ff20448834be77dc325234211669d2b44d35aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/0/f00d7874c8d9963f58f200483d3f87a44cd9a106.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{(\\frac{1}{2})^{2}} - \\frac{1}{\\frac{1}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"75\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/2/642ce8183cf5be69c8762b7a05f30496bbeaef33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{1}{\\frac{1}{4}} - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"67\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/a/daaf7fddf1e61f692b0a9a5ebed60592ab56e23a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=4 - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/f/02feac2e77869c58d31a1f35ca2bc358e5a7758a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=2$\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Since this matches <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in the original equation, we have a correct answer.\n</p><p>We also realize that if we convert the equation into a quadratic, the degree would have to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, there must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> roots (not necessarily distinct). This means that these two roots are the only two solutions.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018010914\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 213/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8280/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.164      1 2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    6.164      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35910:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018010914 and revision id 279201. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}